  "stem": "<p>The area of a rectangular region is increasing at a rate of <math alttext=\"250\"><mn>250</mn>\n</math> square feet per hour. Which of the following is closest to this rate in <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">square meters per minute</span>? <math alttext=\"left parenthesis Use 1 meter  equals 3.28 feet period right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mtext>Use</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>meter</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>3.28</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>feet.</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
